text:
Tuzuukuke,tumwebaze;
Awamu n'ababe bonna;
Abayimba-amatendo ge,
Mu ggulu ne mu nsi zonna.

Tuyambe-obutayogera,
Bya kuyombagana byonna;
Kuuma,wunjula-amaaso go;
Okulaba-ebitasaana.

Otenderezebwenga nnyo;
Ggwe Kitaffe-era n'Omwana,
Naawe Omwoyo-Omutukuvu;
Ggwe-afuga-emirembe gyonna.

Sanyukira-enjuba ye-eyo;
Evuddeyo,
Yambala amaanyi go;
-Obudde bw'ekiro bukedde:
Ye-akubedde,
Akuggye mu kabi-ako.

Ggwe wekka ssuubi lyaffe,
So tewali akwenkana,
Beera kumpi gye tuli;
Mu makubo g'obulamu
Tulyoke tutuuke-eyo;
Mu ggulu.

GY'OLI Yesu tuwaayo
Olunaku lwo luno;
Ggwe wekka obimanyi nnyo;
Tuleme-okulwonoona,
Otuwe-emikisa gyo.

MUSANA mulungi
Oli ne Kitaffe;
Ow'ekitiibwa,-ekingi,
Wakka ku lwa -ababi;
Mulokozi Yesu,
Twesiimye-okukulaba.

GUWEDDEWO-omusana;
Yesu tweyanza ggwe;
Ekiro tukusaba
Tuleke ebibi;

Emirimu giwedde;
Tukwegayirira,
-Otuggyeko-akabi konna;
Otuzibirenga.

Obudde bw'obulamu buziba,
Bwaka katono ne buwungeera;
Byonna eby'ensi bifuuka bidiba;
Ggwe-atadiba-,atafuuka,tondeka.

Nkwetaaga ggwe-emisana n'ekiro;
Kisa kyo kyokka Ssetaani ky'atya;
Katonda wange, bwe bijja-ebire;
-Omusana bwe gwaka,beera nange.

Siriiko kye ntya,Yesu nga wooli;
Beera nange ne mpangula-ebibi;
Owoomesa-amaziga n'ennaku:
Entaana nnafu,n'okufa kufu.

Bonna bonna bakusinza 
Yesu, mu kitiibwa kyo;
Jjangu,Mulokozi waffe
Olye-Obwakabaka bwo
Tukusuute;
Jjangu,Mukama waffe.

LABA,anaawasa-omugole ekiro ajja;
-Abatukuvu, mufulume-okumusisinkana;
Mmwe mwesibenga nnyo-ebiwato byammwe n'ebimyu,
Era-ettabaaza zammwe zaakirenga ddala nnyo.

Mmwe-abagayaavu n'babi,ziribasanga mmwe;
Mwebase,temweteeseteese,mmwe mwerabidde;
Abo bokka-abeeteeseteese,ne bayingira 
Mu mbaga ye; mmwe -temuliyinza kuyingira

Katonda, Katonda;
Ye musana gwa nsi:
Teyagaana kufuuka omuntu;
Katonda ddala,-Omwana si mutonde.

Naffe twanguwe-okugulumiza 
Ekisa-ekingi-eky'Omulokozi;
Tujjukirenga-ekisa kye kyonna 
Ekyamuleeta-okutufiirira; 
Bwotutyo bwe tunaamuyimbira 
Kabaka waffe-ow'olubeerera

Obulungi bwa Kitaffe! 
Ekisa ky'Omwana Yesu; 
Ffe endiga twakyama; 
-Olw'ebibi byaffe byonna; 
Naye fenna watuwa 
-Essanyu ery'omu ggulu.
Singa gye tuli,
Singa gye tuli.

MU kibuga kya Dawudi
Eky'e Beesirekemu,
Omwazaalirwa Omwana,
Mu kiraalo eky'ente;
Omwana-oyo ye Yesu;
Nnyina ye Maliyamu

Ye yakka mu nsi ku lwaffe,
Ye Mukama wa byonna;
Yabeeranga n'abakopi,
Mu kyalo-ekinyoomebwa;
Yakwananga-abanaku, 
N'asembezanga-ababi

Yesu mu buto bwe bwonna, 
Yalinga muwombeefu;
Yayagalanga nnyo nnyina,
Ne bakulu be bonna;
N'abaana bonna mu nsi 
Bakolenga bwe batyo

Ayi Mukama Yesu,fenna-abaana bo;
Tukutendereza,tukweyanza ggwe:
Aleruuya mu nsi,Aleruuya nnyo;
Obulamu buzze,obulamu bwo.

Eyatonda-ebintu byonna,
Era awataali ye 
N'ekimu-ekyakolebwa;
Obulamu bw'ali mu ye 
Atutukuza fenna;

Nga Kitaawe bwe yatuma;
Yagutuusa-omulimu,
Yayigiriza,yawonya,
Yafa,-era yazuukira; 
Era alifuga-abantu 
Bonna nga Omuwanguzi;

Kibuyaga n'emisana,
Ennimiro n'emigga; 
Ebbugumu n'omuzira, 
-Amayengo n'ebibira,
-Obulamu n'ebizinga 
Binaasuuta-erinnya lye;

LABA Omwana mu kiraalo-omu;
Ye Kabaka wa bakabaka;
Talina kifo-okuzaalirwamu
Naye yeetikka-ekibi byaffe.

OMWANA-e Beesirekemu
Beesirekemu;
Omwana-azaaliddwa-omuto

Endiga-,endogoyi n'ente; 
-Endogoyi n'ente 
Zaasinza Kabaka waazo;

N'essanyu abatukuvu 
Abatukuvu; 
Baalaba obulokozi;

Bo baagenda mangu nnyo
Okunoonya-Omwana-oyo;
Eyafuga-ensi zonna 
N'akka ku lwaffe-ababi;
Bwe tutyo twanguweko 
Tunoonye-Omulokozi.

Yesu ggwe-ennaku zonna 
-Otukuumenga-olw'ekisa;
N'eby'ensi bwe biriggwaawo;
-Otutwalenga n'essanyu 
Etabeera nzikiza,
Gy'olabikira ddala.

Mu nsi ey'omu ggulu 
Tebeetaaga ttabaaza; 
Ggwe musana n'essanyu, 
Ggwe njuba eteggwaawo,
Yesu otutuuseeyo; 
Tusuutenga-erinnya lyo

Jjangu Enjuba-Entukuvu 
Mulisa-ensi zonna;
Bonna bajjule-essanyu lyo;
Mu mitima gyabwe.

Ku lw'entuuyo ez'omusaayi,
N'amaziga go gonna;
Ge watonnyesa mu nsi.

Tetwanganga kugenda 
Gy'oli mu kitiibwa kyo;
Eyamanyiira-ennaku;
Otusaasire,Yesu.

Amalagala,
N'ensansa nga bawuuba; 
Ozaana waggul(u) ennyo.

Wakubibwa n'oduulirwa kitalo;
Ennaku ze walaba tezirabwa;
Awo-ne bakukomererawaggulu 
Ku musaalaba.

Yesu waali! eyafa,
Okununula ffe-abantu;
Leero tumusuute nnyo 
N'emyoyo emirongoofu;
Aleruuya!

Okutya n'okufa 
 Yesu ye abiwangudde-olwa leero;
 Yesu atwagala;
 Mu kufa n'obulamu-abeera naffe,
 Naye sing(a) entaana yamusibiri ddala,essuubi liruwa?
 Naye Kristo mulamu:yavaamu,yavaamu,yava mu ntaana.

-Amaanyi gonna-ag'emagombe 
Yagamenyera ddala,
N'atuggulira oluggi 
Lw'obulamu-obutaggwaawo-.
Yesu yava mu magombe;
Ffe ku bubwe tulivaamu-;
Ye yayingira mu ggulu;
Naffe tulituukayo.

Ekitiibwa-eri Kitaffe,
N'eri-Omwana we Yesu;
N'eri-Omwoyo-Omutukuvu 
Era-omu mu Busatu;
Ekitiibwa kibe gy'ali,
Ensi zimuyimbire;
Ettendo libe mu ggulu,
-Era n'emirembe ku nsi

-OMWOYO-Omutukuvu
Oyingire mu ffe;
Emitima gyaffe
Gijjule-okwagala;
Mubeezi waffe yakira
Mu bulamu bwaffe bwonna.

N'abawonya-ennaku zaabwe,n'abawa-obulamu bwe,
Ne baweebwa-obutuukirivu ku lw'omusaayi gwe;
Era-engoye zaabwe zonna ne zimasamasa nnyo;
Yesu n'abafuula-abaana,n'abasanyukirako

Bwe baabeera mu nsi muno,bo baalwana n'amaanyi;
Ne balaba-ennaku nnyingi,ne bakolwa obubi;
Ne bakubibwa-amayinja,ne bajoogebwa-ababi;
Ne baduulirwa-ab'ettima,bwe baalumwa bwe batyo

Olw'abatukuvu abeebaka,
Nga baatula-erinnya lyo-ettukuvu;
Aleruuya,Aleruuya!

Be twayagalanga ffe 
Bwe baba nga beebase 
Ne tweraliikirira 
Ne tubeera mu nnaku;
Ka tuleke-okukaaba;
Tuliwona,bw'alijja.

Bwe tulaba ennaku,
Tetunyiiga n'akamu;
Okufiirwa bannaffe 
N'ennaku ze tulaba;
Tubigumiikirize,
Okutuusa lw'alijja.

Bw'atyo ffe bwe yatuweebwa 
Okuzaalibwa mu nsi;
Yagumiikiriza-ennaku
Anyweze-obubaka bwe;
Yabonyaabonyezebwa nnyo
Okutuusa ku kufa.

Kale ka tutende Yesu,
Ku lw'embaga ye eno;
Mu kifo ky'ebibi-eby'ensi 
Tufune-eby'omu ggulu;
-Essubi lyaffe libeerenga 
Mu ye ow'olubeerera.

Ggwe Ayi Mukama Omwana 
-Eyazaalibwa-omu yekka;
Ggwe Ayi Mukama Katonda,
-Omwana gw'endiga Yesu; 
Aggyawo ebibi by'ensi,
-Otusaasire,Ayi Yesu.

Muyingire mu nzigi ze;
Musemberere n'empya ze;
Erinnya lye lisinzibwe,
Mujje mumuvuunamire.

Oweebwe nnyo ekitiibwa 
Ayi ggwe Kitaffe;
Naawe-Omwana,naawe-Omwoyo 
Omutukuvu;
Obusatu -Obutukuvu 
Otenderezebwenga.

ENKYA bwe nzuukuka,
Bwe mba ngolokose;
Nnasuutanga Katonda

GGWE wekka-ataggwaawo,ow'amagezi
Ggwe-amasamasa-ennyo tetukulaba;
Oweebwe-ekitiibwa,ggwe Ayi Katonda;
Ggwe Ayinza-byonna tukusinza nnyo.

Ggwe-agaba-obulamu mu bintu byonna,
Byonna bibeerawo ku lulwo wekka;
Tugejja ne twanya ng'omuddo gw'ensi;
Mangwago gukala; ggwe tokyukako.

Mu yeekaalu ya Katonda,
Ng'atudde ku ntebe ye;
Bakkeerubi,Basseraafi;
Bayimba-Antifoona-eno:

Tukusinza ggwe wekka,
Nga tusuuta-erinnya lyo;
Emikisa gyo-emingi,
Gy'otuwa mu kisa kyo.
Ffe abatasaanira;
Kyetuva tweyanza-ennyo.

WEEBAZE ggwe-emmeeme yange,
eebaze mwoyo gwange;
-Olw'ekitiibwa kye ekingi-ennyo,
Leeta-ettndo lyo lyonna;
Aleruuya,Aleruuya!
Weebaze Katonda wo.

Kyebava bafaanana-abatukuvu;
Kyebava bayimba abangi wamu;
Ggwe Yesu wekka eyatutukuza,
Oweebwe-ekitiibwa ennaku zonna.

Yesu,ffe fenna twandifudde bufi;
Watwagala ne bwe twali ababi;
N'otusaasira ggwe n'otutukuza;
Oweebwe-ekitiibwa ennaku zonna.

Ekisa kyo Mukama waffe,
Tekikomezeka;
Baakuduulira, ne bakukuba,
Naye n'osirika;
Baakutikkira amaggwa,
Ne bakuttira ku muti!

TETWAKULABA bwe wajja
N'otambula mu nsi yaffe;
So tetwalaba nnyumba yo,
Mu kyalo ekinyoomebwa;
Naye bwe tubiwulira
Tukkirza-era twebaza

Tetwakulaba bwe wafa 
Ku lwaffe ku musaalaba;
Era ne bwe wakoowoola,
Tetwakuwulira n'omu;
Naye bwe tubirowooza 
Twewuunya nga tukankana.

Tetwaliwo bwe walinnya 
Mu ggulu eri Kitaawo;
-Abatume bwe baatunula
Nga beekaliriza-amaaso;
Naye tumanyira ddala 
Nti baakulaba ng'ogenda.

Era kaakano ng'okufa,
Ffe nga tukulindirira;
Tetulaba kitiibwa kyo;
Okitukwese mu ggulu:
Naye tumanyi ng'olijja 
N'ebire mu kitiibwa kyo.

Wayimusanga emyoyo gy'abavubuka;
Abantu bonna wabaweereza;
Newakubadde ggwe oli Kabaka wawu,
Naye oli kiddukiro kyaffe.

Emirimu gy'engalo 
N'okufuba kw'omwoyo 
N'amaziga agajja-ennyo 
Emisana n'ekiro;
Byonna tebiggyawo bibi;
Ggwe wekka Mulokozi.

Sirina nze bulungi 
Nkwesize ggwe bwesizi;
Omwereere nnyambaza;
Omunaku mpa-ekisa;
Laba bwe ndi omubi,
Nnaaza Yesu,nfa bufi.

GGWE eyantnda-olw'a-okwagala kwo
Leka nze ntwale ku kifaananyi kyo;
Ggwe era-eyannonya ku lwa-ekisa
Newankubadde nga nkyamye-ewala;
Ggw(e) ayitiibwa wekka nti kwagala;
Leka neeweeyo mbeeren(ga) owuwo.

Ggwe-eyazaalibwa,n'ofuuka-omuntu 
Mu ngeri yaffe,awatali kibi;
N'olyoka-otulokola ffe-abantu,
Ng'ofumitibwa, n'otufiirira.
Ggw(e) ayitiibwa wekka nti kwagala;
Leka neeweeyo mbeeren(ga) owuwo.

Ggwe-eyansuubiza olw'obwesigwa,
Nti ng'omaze-okufa ndikuzuukiza;
Ggwe-afuga wekka ebintu byonna,
-Eby'omu nsi muno, n'eby'omu ggulu.
Ggw(e) ayitiibwa wekka nti kwagala;
Leka neeweeyo mbeeren(ga) owuwo.

Yesu yeebazibwe;
Ebyonoono byange;
Byakomererwa ku muti,
Kwe yafiirira nze

Mumutende YEsu-Omununuzi waffe
Ab'omu ggulu mumuyimbire;
Yesu afuga-emirembe n'emirembe;
Nga Kabaka; mumusseeko-engule.
Ye alidda okugoba-abalabe,
Obuyinza n'ekitiibwa bibye.

Yanzigya mu balabe,
N'anfuula omwana we;
Yanzigya mu bujeemu
N'anfuula-omutukuvu;
Nnyinza ntya-okumalayo 
-Ebbanja lyange-eryenkanaawo-?

Bwe ndituuka mu ggulu 
Olw'obutuukirivu;
Obwa Yesu,si bwange,
Bwe ndiraba-amaaso ge;
Ne ndyoka ntegeereraawo-
-Ebbanja bwe litaggwaayo.

Yesu-Omulokozi,
Ye-afuga n'ekisa;
Eyatufiirira 
Ye-atudde ku ntebe;
Muyimuse emitiima,
Musanyuke,mujaguze.

Ggwe bulamu ggwe-ow'amaanyi;
Wawangula-okufa;
Abo bonna-abakwesiga 
Bawonye okufa.

Twewadde mu mikono gyo;
Twesiga amagezi go.
Tumaleemu-ebibi byaffe;
Twewaddeyo-,otulokole.

GGWE-oli Mutukuvu,Mukama Katonda;
Enkya tukusuuta,tuyimbaa-ettendo lyo.
Ggwe-oli Mutukuvu,wa kisa,wa maanyi;
Katonda omu,mu Busatu.

Mutukuvu wekka,tewali mulala;
Ffe-ab'omu kizikiza,tetukulaba;
Ggwe-oli Mutukuvu,obasinga bonna,
-Amaanyi,-amagezi,era n'ekisa.

Twali tunyoomebwa,twali banaku;
Bangi ku lulwo n'okufa ne bafa;
Ggwe watubeera,n'atuwonnya mu kabi 
Tuwe-emirembe gyo mu biro byaffe.

Kale mmwe-ebizinga 
Ebiri mu nnyanja;
Empewo-ennyingi-ennyo 
Zikuntira ku mmwe;
Zirongoosa ekkubo lye 
Kabaka ow'ekitiibwa.

Mwenna muyimbe nnyo,
Nga mugenda gy'ali;
Mwenna mukumgaane 
-Okuva mu nsi zonna;
Tuyingire mu kibuga,
Ekyaffe,-eky'olubeerera.

Mulokozi,ffe fenna 
Tweyanze nnyo nnyini;
-Okuwangula si kwaffe,
Tumaanyi nga kukwo;
Wawangula Ssetaani,
-Omulabe waffe-oyo;
Naffe tetumutyenga,
Tujaguze leero

Mugende mu maaso;
Laba ebbendera;
Nga yo ebakulembera 
-Omugabe ye Yesu

Ababeera mu kibuga 
Bambala entukuvu;
Bayoza engoye zaabwe 
Mu musaayi gwa Yesu;
Bava mu mawanga gonna,
Ne bafuuka-abaana be;
Edda baali bamwonoona,
Kaakano balokole.

Ayi Yesu olw'ekisa kyo,
Eyo gye ndibeerera;
Abantu ab'ensi eno 
Bannyoome,banduulire;
Naye-essanyu lyabwe lyonna 
Teriyinza kulwawo;
Ery'abaana ba Katonda,
Lya mirembe-egitaggwaawo-.

Nze nakuggya mu nvuba;
Ne nnyiga-ebiwundu byo;
Ne nkuzuula ng'obuze;
Ne nzibula-amaaso go.

Bulijjo nze nkwagala;
Naabeeranga naawe nze;
Mu bulamu, mu kufa,
Mu magombe,mu ggulu.

Bwe ndiba nkuwonyezza
Oliraba-ettendo-eryo;
Oliba wamu nange;
Mwana wange-,onjagala?

Ye atwagala,atwagala;
Ye atwagala aboonoonyi;
Era yajj(a) okutufiirira,
Ffe tutuuke gy'oli.

Ye atwagala,atwagala;
Ye atwagala aboonoonyi;
Era yajj(a) okutufiirira,
Ffe tutuuke gy'oli.

Ye atwagala,atwagala;
Ye atwagala aboonoonyi;
Era yajj(a) okutufiirira,
Ffe tutuuke gy'oli.

Ayi Mukama,njija gy'oli;
Onzikirize:
Ajja gye ndi simugobera-

Abazibe b'amaaso ab'enzikiza;
Yesu gwe musana gw'ensi;
Mugende munaabe,munaazibuka;
Yesu gwe musana gw'ensi.

Bwe mbeera mu ye,siriko kye ntya;
Ye ngabo,ge mafumu gange;
Ge maanyi gange-agataliggwaawo
Agayinza-abalabe bonna

Munaabe mu musaa(yi),ogunaaza mmwe buli kibi;
Mmwe temulitukul(a) awatali ye;
Munaabe mu musaa(yi) gwa Yesu.

Munaabe mu musaa(yi),ogunaaza mmwe buli kibi;
Mmwe temulitukul(a) awatali ye;
Munaabe mu musaa(yi) gwa Yesu.

Munaabe mu musaa(yi),ogunaaza mmwe buli kibi;
Mmwe temulitukul(a) awatali ye;
Munaabe mu musaa(yi) gwa Yesu.

Munaabe mu musaa(yi),ogunaaza mmwe buli kibi;
Mmwe temulitukul(a) awatali ye;
Munaabe mu musaa(yi) gwa Yesu.

Leero terunnaggalwa oluggi lw'eggulu;
Lukyali-awo luggule okuyingiramu.
Kale tolwa,yanguwa okuyita omwo;
Katonda-akugamba ntiKale jjangu leero.

Naye ggwe-oli wange,nange wuwo;
Nze mwonoonyi,ggwe Katonda ddala;
Onnyweze kumpi mu kifuba kyo,
N'emikono gyo gye baafumita.

Tufudde bwe tutasaba;
Yesu,otusabire;
Bwe tuba tugenda gy'oli,
Ggwe otwanirize.

Ayi Yesu Mukama,
Tomganya kuwaba;
Mu nzikiza nga ssiraba;
Mulisa-ekkubo lyo.

YIMIRIRA mu ffe;
Mukama-ow'amaanyi;
Ffe abakusaba
Otuwe-omukisa.

Sonyiwa-ebyonoono byange 
Ng'obinaaza n'omussayi-
-Ogw'Omulokozi Yesu;
Nsonyiwanga bulijjo,
Ne mu maanyi ga Ssetaani;
Lokola omwoyo gwange;
Lokla omwaoyo nga nsaba ggwe,
Ndokolanga bulijjo.

YESU,leero nkukoowoola
Ombeere nkwegayirira,
Obulokozi bwo ndaga;

Obujeemu bwange n'obubi,
Ggwe-omanyi ddala bwe biri:
Ka nkwesige ggwe bwesizi;

Siyinza kweteekateeka,
Siyinza kwegendereza;
Olw'erinnya lyo ndokola:

Naweerezanga Ssetaani,
Mu nnaku ez'edda;
Ekisa kyo kye kyansenza;
Yesu anjagla.

SIYINZA n'akatono
Yesu nga toliiwo;
Okulwana-akaseera
Mu maaso g'ekibi;
Abalabe bange bonna
Bantaayiza bubi;
Omulokozi wange,
Ombeere n'amaanyi.

GGWE-asuutibwa buli muntu,
Kkiriza-eteendo lyaffe;
-Okusobya kwe tukoze ffe,
Twenenyerezza ddala;
-Ebirabo bye tukuwa ffe,
-Obitwale n'omukisa gwo;
-Ogutuwe,ggwe Kabaka.

MWENNA musanyuke leero,
Muyimbe n'okujaguza;
Mmwe mumutende Mukama;
Wa maanyi,Omulokozi:
By'akola biraga
Erinnya lye-eddungi;
Ye yekka Katonda;
Laba ekisa kye:
Mmw(e) abatukuvu musuute!

MUKAMA bwe yamggamba nti
Jja,osembere gye ndi;
Owummule ggwe-akooye-ennyo
Ennaku z'omu nsi;
Ne nsembera nga bwe nnali
Nga nnakuwadde nze;
N'angabira-okuwummula,
Kaakano nsanyuse.

MUKAMA,nze nnina-ebibi;
Naye ekisa kyo kingi;
Ompise okujja gy'oli;
Yesu,njija.

Yesu,Omwana gw'endiga,
Olw'ebibi byange wafa;
-Omusaayi gwo ngukkiriza;
Yesu,njija.

Okwagala kwo okunene 
N'ekisa kyo bimpaludde;
Kye njagula,kusenga ggwe;
Yesu,njija.

OMWOYO n'omubiri,
Yesu ka mbikuwe;
Neewaayo nga ssaddaaka;
Omuliro gujje.

Omwoyo n'oomubiri,
Yesu ka mbikuwe;
Neewaayo nga ssaddaaka;
Omuliro gujje.

Omwoyo n'oomubiri,
Yesu ka mbikuwe;
Neewaayo nga ssaddaaka;
Omuliro gujje.

Omwoyo n'oomubiri,
Yesu ka mbikuwe;
Neewaayo nga ssaddaaka;
Omuliro gujje.

Mu nzikiza bwe ntambula,
Onjakize-omusana gwo;
Nneme-okubulira ddala;
Beera nange, Mulokozi.

Bwe ndituuka-eyo mu ggulu
Ndikwakaliriza-amaaso;
Ne ntendereza-amaaso;
Ne ntendereza ggwe-eyampa,
Obulamu obutaggwaawo-.

Sirina akanaakusanyusa
Mukama wange, nze munaku wo;
Edda nali seewangayo gy'oli,
Naye leero mpoza kino kyokka;
onjagala.

SIRIIKO kye mpoza,Yesu;
Mu maaso go,gunsinze nnyo;
Ekisa kyo kiwangudde
Obunafu bwange bwonna.

Mukama wange,jjangu
Fuga-omwoyo guno;
Tegukyali ku bwange;
Gugwo wekka leero.

Naye mpozzi tuliraba-akabi;
Kale tumwesige-Omulokozi;
Ye taalemenga kutujjanjaba 
Gye tuligenda yonna.

Ffe tuli bato,ggwe-oli mukulu;
Ggwe-olina-amanyi,tuli banafu;
Mu nsi muno tukugoberere,
Tutuulenga naawe-eyo

Buli kaseera nkusaba 
Weeyongere-okumpalula;
Byonna mbireke,wabula 
Ebiva mu bulungi bwo;
Njijule-ebyo by'ontonera 
N'okusinga okwagala.

Twetaaga Yesu:Yesu Musaale waffe 
Mu nzikiza mwe tutambulira;
Nga tumweyabiza,tulaba-essanyu;
Ye ngabo yaffe,gye twambalira.

Twetaaga Yesu:Olwazi lw'emirembe;
Katonda kwe yatuyimiriza;
Nga tumulaba,tetuwunjawunja,
So tetubaako kyonna kye tutya.

Twetaaga Yesu:mu biro by'okulumwa;
Tewali-amwenkana-okusaasira;
N'okutuwa n'atuwa obutamma 
Amaanyi ge agatuwanguza.

OTUKULEMBERE
-Mu kkubo lyaffe;
Yesu tujja kwanguwako
Okukugobereranga;
Kwata-omukono
Otutuuse-ewuwo!

-Ekisa kyo ekintuusizza kaakano
Tekiggwaawo;
Tekiiremenga kunneetooloolanga 
-Ennaku zonna;
Era ne mu ggulu bwe mdituukayo 
Naayimbanga-okutendereza Yesu.

Mu kkubo-ery'okufa,twali tubula;
Nga tubulubuuta mu kizikiza;
Naye watuwonya gye twakyamira 
Mu lukoola-ewala,n'otulokola.

Kale nno bannange tugende fenna,
N'obugumu bungi mu kkubo lyaffe;
Yesu ye Musaale,akulembera;
Mu bukoowu bwaffe atusanyusa.

NAKOLA nnyo naye saagasibwa;
Nafuba nnyo naye saawummula;
Yesu kaakano-ampadde-ekisa kye.
Ampummuzizza mu mikono gye.
Gy'ali gye njagala-okutuuka-eyo
Nze ndi wuwe naye wange ddala.

Otwoleke okwagala 
Naffe tukwagale;
Newankubadde okufa;
Tekulitwawula.

